    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0050_006_01:ChrEv_0050_006_01_004:f47649d4",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0050_006_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0050_006_01_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0050_006_01:ChrEv_0050_006_01_004:f47649d4",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0050_006_01:ChrEv_0050_006_01_004:f47649d4",
        "jp_sha256": "f5630aa68a649509090bfe0ca26faf24f752107c7e6a1efc5d14b1308c50863c",
        "official_en_sha256": "66c617e739e91a37366394506aece7cbdb02a0f89c19026c1d5966b3d0747c9d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この宝玉は、初代水の巫女が作ったものです。\r\nどのような目的で作ったのかは\r\n今となってはわかりませんが……。",
        "official_en": "This gem was wrought by the First Water Maiden. For what purpose, I am now farther from understanding than ever...",
        "real_en": "The first Water Maiden made this gem. I no longer know what she made it for, though..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
