        "official_en_sha256": "46f7befb111449c74c53e288f97c726f0563b5a1167d0113b5b40cbfcfc5515d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "どんなことが起ころうと、\r\n水神様への信頼が揺らいだりはしません。",
        "official_en": "Our trust in you will never waver, no matter what may arise.",
        "real_en": null
