      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水神様……聞こえますか？\r\n宝玉を取り返して来ました。",
        "official_en": "O divine God of Water...can you hear me? We have brought your gem back to you.",
        "real_en": "God of Water... Can you hear me?\r\nWe’ve recovered your gem."
