        "official_en_sha256": "3c586348bd61f33317430b7801f0152d9c6a5cc30f91d49e9b3eec05dcbedc67"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水神様の大きな力……。\r\nオルデリオンだけでなく、\r\nこれからは世界のために役立てないと。",
        "official_en": "The immense power of the God of Water lies in our hands... It must now be used for the good of the world.",
        "real_en": "The God of Water’s immense power...\r\nWe must use it not only for Olderion,\r\nbut for the whole world from now on."
