      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "私の守護と水の守り人の献身により、\r\nオルデリオンは魔物に襲われることなく、\r\n安全に発展してきました。",
        "official_en": "With my protection and the dedication of the Wardens of the Waters, Olderion has been able to thrive, free from monster attacks.",
